// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2029260204" "There's only one person left on Bowman's hit list, {HeroName}. <color red>Charles Monroe, the CEO of Syfotine Industries</color>. We're not waiting for the seers to report a disturbance, <color orange>I want you to go in and bring him into our custody now, for his own protection</color>."
// AcceptString :
"P2487266079" "Bring Monroe into custody"
// SendOffString :
"P3251853433" "Remember, just because the seers haven't detected any disturbances doesn't mean that there isn't a danger. If anything changes the seers will alert you.<br><br><color orange>Get in there and bring Monroe out</color>. Don't accept any resistance on the matter."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1762550161" "Syfotine Industries is located in South Aetna. The seers still haven't detected any disturbances, but if the Syndicate are behind these killings, I suspect we won't until it's too late."
