"P4040996835" "Oh my god, look out!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P1225066060" "Hey, I heard that the Chief Interrogator is in the building..."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P3359769272" "Shhh..."
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P66081968" "<em t=5>What? Why?"
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P3175527682" "<em t=1>Hi."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P645423515" "It's the Syndicate!"
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P4221840087" "<shout>Everybody, heads down!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2836457115" "Now you die!"
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P129604123" "<shout>Dodge this!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2194629193" "Rico"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYINFO :
"P2970223219" "Jon Rico is a famous bodybuilder and on Erica Swift's payroll as her personal bodyguard, and if the rumors are true his duties don't stop there."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2247805553" "<shout>Come on!"
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3074886505" "<shout>Stop them!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P114218955" "Warburton"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYINFO :
"P104652317" "Marcus Warburton has worked as a bodyguard since the end of the Hamidon Wars. He is currently in the employ of Swift Microcomms working as a security advisor and consultant."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3338468367" "No way!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2603631586" "Kennedy"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYINFO :
"P295154982" "Thomas Kennedy once served on Cole's presidential security staff. It appears that the Syndicate found use for his services after they were no longer needed by Cole."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3958186695" "<shout>Take 'em down!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2787488205" "You!"
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P3815558869" "<shout>Now we have you!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P1177842266" "<shout>Stop Powers Division!"
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P3403755889" "<shout>Cornered!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2494329443" "La Torre"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYINFO :
"P1763432999" "Timothy La Torre, also known as 'The Tower', is well known amongst the PPD. He was a former PPD officer who got hired by Swift Microcomms as a security analyst."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2940684214" "<shout>Don't let them escape!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3668623983" "Finally, the chase ends."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P954777562" "Stevens"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYINFO :
"P2677399774" "Trent Stevens is Mrs. Swift's personal bodyguard, though it is clear now that he and the rest of the muscle in her employ are actually Syndicate killers."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2776180058" "<shout>Mrs. Swift is in trouble!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P651827562" "<shout>Let's move!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P2756536359" "<shout>We've got trouble!"
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3034407589" "<shout>Go go!"
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P1367660886" "<shout>The boss needs us!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3581141547" "Aiiieee!"

