// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4004554726" "You arrested Erica Swift, CEO of Swift Telecommunications and secret member of the Syndicate.<br><br>Report to Chief Interrogator Washington for debriefing."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P618683668" "Mrs. Swift is in custody and the entire building is on lockdown as we investigate everyone for connections to the Syndicate.<br><br>We're getting some disturbing reports, but I'll get to those in a moment.<br><br>You did well in there, {HeroName}, I can see why Michael put in a good word for you with me."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1617011679" "{HeroName}, I apologize for my deception... you must think me a wolf in sheep's clothing..."
// Answer Text :
"P1174251089" "You are a monster, Monroe."
// Answer Text :
"P256764422" "Not a wolf, just a common criminal in an expensive suit."
// Answer Text :
"P1402053357" "You're as much a wolf as any other man."
// Answer Text :
"P2454737647" "(Explain Calvin Scott's plan to Monroe.)"
// Page MonsterPage1 Text :
"P905665327" "I'm not a monster.I'll prove it to you. Allow me to show you what the Syndicate is really about."
// Answer Text :
"P2439443958" "They're about money, pure and simple."
// Answer Text :
"P1105109111" "I don't need you to show me that they are society's worst."
// Page MoneyPage1 Text :
"P4138072771" "We are about money, and there is no good reason why some of that can't be yours."
// Answer Text :
"P1530221768" "I'm listening..."
// Answer Text :
"P1755698856" "You can't bribe me, Monroe, I'm taking you down."
// Page ListeningPage1 Text :
"P3401748910" "Every {Hero.gender=male man|woman} has {Hero.gender=male his|her} price. Whatever you want, it's yours. Now let's put this ugly little event behind us."
// Answer Text :
"P1667478626" "Agreed. It has been good doing business with you."
// Page SocietyPage1 Text :
"P4197131987" "Not the worst of society, {HeroName}, we are its best.<em>I think you would fit in nicely with us up here at the top."
// Answer Text :
"P1572644084" "You want me to join you?"
// Answer Text :
"P2413922261" "I'll never join you."
// Page JoinPage1 Text :
"P16011471" "Think of the power, {HeroName}. By joining us your every need will be satisfied. Your dreams, your desires - fulfilled!<br><br>Together we can shape the world to our liking rather than cater to others too impotent to pursue their own dreams."
// Answer Text :
"P3787824419" "...I'm in. Let's get you out of here."
// Answer Text :
"P2277458590" "You're a madman drunk on delusions of his power."
// Page CriminalPage1 Text :
"P216743611" "I AM just a common man in an expensive suit, {HeroName}, but my status as a criminal remains solely in your hands."
// Answer Text :
"P1751114121" "What're you getting at?"
// Page DecisionPage1 Text :
"P3124741661" "We are at a crossroads, my {Hero.gender=male friend|dear}. You can arrest me, or you can join with me!<br><br>Think of it, {Hero.gender=male man|lass}, what we could accomplish together with my wealth and your power!"
// Answer Text :
"P2159246885" "I have to admit, that has a certain allure to it. I accept."
// Answer Text :
"P1045642762" "Join you? You're insane. I'm taking you in!"
// Page ManPage1 Text :
"P1450115669" "We are all wolves, aren't we? Struggling to survive.<br><br> I knew there was something different about you."
// Answer Text :
"P4007442647" "It's no secret that every man has a price."
// Answer Text :
"P1445269077" "You're right, I am different. I can't be bought and sold."
// Page PricePage1 Text :
"P917874427" "Wise words, {HeroName}. We do all have a price, so what's yours?"
// Answer Text :
"P3390972258" "Power."
// Answer Text :
"P2914174590" "Money."
// Answer Text :
"P1349176038" "Something you don't have to offer, Monroe - Loyalty."
// Page PowerPage1 Text :
"P871961574" "Ah yes, Power... You will have that and more. Join the Syndicate, {HeroName}, we could use someone like you."
// Answer Text :
"P1071986830" "Power for myself, Monroe, not for any other. You're going down."
// Page CalvinPage1 Text :
"P2361238604" "...!<br><br>Most interesting, {HeroName}. This is a possibility that I had not calculated..."
// Answer Text :
"P2565346023" "Calculate it after you are taken into custody..."
// Page CalvinPage2 Text :
"P2427363774" "After I am in custody?<br><br>Surely you jest my {Hero.gender=male boy|dear}. Why would I willingly enter custody at all when I am already about to make my escape. Assuming of course you don't impede my egress."
// Answer Text :
"P2880733689" "I can't let you go. I have to uphold my cover with Washington."
// Page CalvinPage3 Text :
"P3602006938" "I can respect your need to maintain an illusion of trust with the Chief Interrogator. But I am uncertain that I can trust you enough to subject myself to that madman's methods of <i>persuasion</i>.<br><br>What guarantee do I have that your friends will come for me?"
// Answer Text :
"P2407146462" "Telling Washington of my affiliation would mean the doom of me."
// Page CalvinPage4 Text :
"P1418367804" ""Very true.<br><br>Well, seeing as how you won't let me leave and my defeat is possible, I acquiesce to your demands."
// Answer Text :
"P1850343729" "Good, so you'll come along quietly?"
// Page AcceptPage1 Text :
"P1495643149" "Then we're in agreement."
// Answer Text :
"P1852003614" "End Discussion"
// Page DeclinePage1 Text :
"P3549973118" "So be it."
// Answer Text :
"P4134249394" "Fight"
// Page CalvinPage5 Text :
"P3792932593" "Oh, I never said that."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - CalvinScott 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1442764454" "{HeroName}, word is you are working with the Chief Interrogator."
// Answer Text :
"P1628504533" "(Explain what you've discovered about the Syndicate infighting.)"
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P3608792374" "Yeah, we've gotten reports from Imperial City as well. Something has happened in the Syndicate ranks, something big. All of our deals with them have either been canceled or attacked by rivals. We need some answers."
// Answer Text :
"P1088731397" "I might be able to get those for you."
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P3303381443" "What did you have in mind?"
// Answer Text :
"P1414357274" "(Explain the situation with Charles Monroe.)"
// Page InformationPage3 Text :
"P789040091" "...the CEO of Swift Microcommunications...<br><br>We need Monroe, and Swift if possible.<br><br>Can you get them for me?"
// Answer Text :
"P3988350360" "I'll do my best, Calvin."
// Answer Text :
"P457542746" "Whoa, slow down there, chief! Swift is in Washington's custody."
// Page MakeItSoPage1 Text :
"P2072534692" "Great. Let Monroe know he's got cavalry coming for him. That should be enough to keep him from cracking under Washington's scrutiny. When we show up, we'll bust them both out and smuggle 'em deep into the Dim."
// Answer Text :
"P3550935187" "I'll make sure he's aware."
// Page WhoaPage1 Text :
"P3126078429" "Relax, {HeroName}. We can't move on Monroe until he's in Washington's hands anyway. To do so would compromise your cover."
// Answer Text :
"P1084409578" "So once Monroe is in custody you'll strike and break them both out?"
// Page WhoaPage2 Text :
"P4243665425" "Precisely, and anyone else we find in there, to help cover up what our true objective was.<br><br>Just let Monroe know he's got friends coming for him, that should be enough to keep him from cracking."
// Answer Text :
"P2627189994" "Alright, I'll make this happen."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2620441074" "Mrs. Swift has taken her interrogation very well, she's already provided me with some intriguing information, namely that she isn't the only member of the Syndicate in this curious case.<br><br>It appears that Charles Monroe and every other CEO on Mr. Bowman's hit list were high ranking Syndicate members, and it just so happens that Mr. Monroe has returned to his office, no doubt to destroy any and all evidence of his involvement. I need you to stop him."
// AcceptString :
"P1163572697" "Stop Monroe"
// SendOffString :
"P637322714" "This isn't some corporate scandal we've stumbled onto, {HeroName}, this is a Syndicate gang war unfolding right under our noses.<br><br>Something's happened in the Syndicate and the blood is spilling into the streets. We need to put a stop to it, but in order to do that, we need to bring Monroe back into custody, or you can be sure that another hit will be ordered and that will endanger innocent lives.<br><br><color Paragon>Players who <i>originally</i> chose Resistance now have the opportunity to call up Calvin Scott to inform him of current events. Messages such as this will appear in missions where this is possible. If you originally did not choose to be in the Resistance, you can not do undercover Resistance work in Loyalist missions; you <i>can</i> do undercover work against the Resistance in their missions. Players who change their faction can still do undercover work for the side they originally chose."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1896645819" "Bring Down Charles Monroe"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1143739101" "You need to hurry. Monroe could be destroying critical evidence or may even be planning to leave the city."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2028306290" "<color deepskyblue>Finale: Wolf in a Wool Suit</color>"

