// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYINFO :
"P617436169" "Charles Monroe is the CEO of Syfotine Industries, but he is much more than that, he's also a powerful member of the shadowy criminal organization known only as the Syndicate. With his secret affiliations revealed, Monroe has no need to hide his powerful psychic abilities any longer."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P811844508" "{HeroName} is on {Hero.gender=male his|her} way here now.<em>Nobody shoots unless I give the order. Understood?"
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1792080103" "You can still walk away, {HeroName}."
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P14927400" "What do you have to gain from taking me down?"
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P2669749282" "<em grief>You're nothing but a blind {Hero.gender=male fool|little girl}, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P3176366443" "No!<em>My... my empire... <em>...gone."
// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P1738159648" "<em victory>I'm afraid this is where we say our goodbyes, {HeroName}."
// Script Variable Greeting :
"P2033712368" "The curtain has been pulled back, my {Hero.gender=male boy|dear}, and now you see me for who I really am."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1400644234" "I must confess that I wasn't quite truthful with you just now.<em>Our little conversation was, by design, a tactic to delay you long enough for my cavalry to arrive.<em>No hard feelings, I hope."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P806144103" "I see, all business then, are we?<em>No matter, our conversation has bought enough time for some of my men to come to my aid."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3751164857" "<shout>Get to Monroe, stop {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1130685984" "Smith"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1072719904" "<shout>Get to Monroe, kill everyone else!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P314267862" "You arrested Charles Monroe, a powerful member of the Syndicate. Return to Chief Interrogator Washington for debriefing."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P108679611" "Amazing work my friend. You've managed to cage two high ranking members of the Syndicate.<br><br>Unfortunately there is still a burning question, and one which I fear may take time to learn the answer to. What has caused The Syndicate to turn on itself?<br><br>I trust that Mr. Monroe and Mrs. Swift will provide the answers in time, until then, I believe the bloodshed may have only just begun."

